<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 2.92 bln levs 8-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 2.92 bln levs 8-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed 2.92 billion levs of eight-day discount T-bills, yielding 4.25 percent until maturity, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the BNB did not say with which financial instituion or institutions the issue was placed on Monday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Price is in percent of par.  Issue number		   BG 3010897000</p>
<p> Par value			2.92 bln levs</p>
<p> Issue date		     January 13, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		  January 21, 1997</p>
<p> Selling price		  95.92 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	    4.25 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
